{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">For the last three years, a pig at a farm gave birth to one litter per year. The table shows the number of piglets in each of these three litters.</p>\n<figure class=\"table\"><table border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\n<th style=\"width: 50%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" scope=\"col\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Litter number</p>\n</th>\n<th style=\"width: 50%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" scope=\"col\">Number of piglets</th>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\"><math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\"><math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\"><math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\"><math alttext=\"7\"><mn>7</mn>\n</math></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\"><math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 22.3906px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\"><math alttext=\"9\"><mn>9</mn>\n</math></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></figure>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the mean number of piglets per litter for these three litters?</p>", "keys": ["941a9e1d-aa88-4f36-a22b-19ff08db1351"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "aff03a52-639a-40da-941f-9857e2f5631d", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "20cd8836-6a8c-4f02-853f-41d4dc7bd9f2", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"7\"><mn>7</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "941a9e1d-aa88-4f36-a22b-19ff08db1351", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "58b80501-a7fc-4fc3-ad84-d7ac995dacf8", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"9\"><mn>9</mn>\n</math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is correct. It's given that the numbers of piglets in litters <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math>, and <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math> are <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"7\"><mn>7</mn>\n</math>, and <math alttext=\"9\"><mn>9</mn>\n</math>, respectively. The mean number of piglets per litter for these three litters is <math alttext=\"StartFraction 8 plus 7 plus 9 Over 3 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"StartFraction 24 Over 3 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>24</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>, or <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is the range of the number of piglets per litter for these three litters.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This is the minimum number of piglets per litter for these three litters.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This is the maximum number of piglets per litter for these three litters.</p>", "externalid": "a214fab5-1eb4-49e2-ad3e-2b74eb180945", "correct_answer": ["C"]}